{
    "title": "AudioLab Audio Editor Recorder",
    "description": "<b>AudioLab - The Only Audio Editor App You Will Ever Need</b>\r\n\r\nWhether you are editing music, creating podcasts, recording memos, or just playing around with audio, AudioLab empowers you to unleash your creativity with unmatched versatility and ease of use. AudioLab - Audio Editor Recorder & Ringtone Maker Free, Easy, Fast With NO Limits!\r\n\r\nYour ultimate audio editing companion tailored for music enthusiasts, podcasters, and music creators who demand powerful tools at their fingertips.\r\n\r\n\ud83c\udfb5AudioLab Advance sound editing features\ud83c\udfb5\r\n\r\n\u2702\ufe0fEasy music editing tools\u2702\ufe0f\r\n\u25cf Easily edit audio and videos all in one place\r\n\u25cf Trim, clip, crop, copy, paste, add silence, fade, normalise, record song \r\n\u25cf Supports every format( mp3, wav, flac, m4a, aac, ogg and more...)\r\n\u25cf Millisecond level accuracy for editing\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udd25Next-level song editing features with Professional Music Tools\ud83d\udd25\r\n\u25cf Easily remove background noise with noise remover tool\r\n\u25cf Normalise your sound and reduce/boost volume\r\n\u25cf Inbuilt music player for playing music at any time\r\n\u25cf 3d audio and 8d audio, voice and music separation\r\n\u25cf Voice recorder, karaoke recorder, record voice with music\r\n\u25cf Mix audio with various filters, sound maker, effects and SFX\r\n\u25cf MP3 cutter, MP3 editor, audio editor, audio trimmer, ringtone maker and ringtone editor\r\n\r\n\u2702\ufe0fSound Editor and MP3 Cutter\u2702\ufe0f\r\nAdvanced user interface to precisely cut best part of your sound and save it as your ringtone, alarm, music and notification\r\n\r\n\ud83c\udf9e\ufe0fVideo editor\ud83c\udfa5\r\nVideo trim, video splitter, video to gif, video music mixer\r\n\r\n\ud83c\udf9b\ufe0fAudio Mixer\ud83c\udf9b\ufe0f \r\nBlend multiple audio tracks seamlessly to create professional-grade mixes\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udd03Audio Convertor, Compress and Format Converter\ud83d\udd03 \r\nConvert audio into other formats without quality loss\r\nSupport multiple formats, MP3, .aac, .wav, .flac, .m4a, .amr, etc\r\n\r\n\ud83c\udfb6Audio Merger\ud83c\udfb6 \r\nMerge different song to create a single music clip that you can export in multiple formats\r\n\r\n\ud83c\udfa4Audio Recorder\u23fa\ufe0f \r\nCapture high-quality sound recordings on the go. Ideal for lectures, interviews, or spontaneous ideas.\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udd96Audio Video Splitting\ud83d\udd96\r\nExtract audio from video files or split any audio and video into multiple clips to create new ringtone songs and custom ringtones\r\n\r\n\u23eaReverse Audio\u23e9 \r\nReverse audio tracks for creative effects and edits.\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udcddText to Speech & Speech to Text\ud83d\udde3\ufe0f\r\nText to speech Read aloud text and convert text, text file to audio speech\r\n\r\n\ud83e\udd16Voice Changer\ud83e\udd16\r\nHave fun modifying your voice with various funny effects such as Helium, Drunk, and Chipmunk\r\n\r\n\ud83c\udfa4Karaoke Vocal\ud83c\udfa4 \r\nRemove vocals from audio tracks to create karaoke or instrumental versions\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udd14Ringtone Maker & Editor\ud83d\udd14\r\nCreate ringtones from your favourite songs or recording. Cut and save audio directly to use as personalized tones\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udd09Noise & Silence Reduction\ud83d\udd07\r\nRemove background noise and unwanted sounds to achieve pristine audio clarity \r\n\r\n\ud83e\udd70Batch Editing\ud83e\udd70\r\n Support batch music mixing, converter, video to audio, and volume booster\r\n\r\n\ud83c\udfa73D Music\ud83c\udfa7\r\nEnhance audio with spatial effects for immersive listening experiences\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udcddTag Editing\ud83d\udcdd\r\nManage and edit metadata tags for audio\r\n\r\nAudioLab - Audio Editor Recorder & Ringtone Maker offers a wide range of features such as audio trimming, sound maker, music mixer, sound editor, ringtone maker, ringtone editor, song merging, tag editing, voice recording, audio video splitting, voice changing, text to speech, video to music conversion, karaoke, audio recorder, fun recorder, vocal removal, 3D music, noise and silence filtering, and many more.\r\n\r\nShape your audio, music, and voice with our versatile editor, ringtone maker, recorder, and video sound editor.\r\n\r\nDownload AudioLab - Audio Editor Recorder & Ringtone Maker free app now and enjoy most powerful audio editor, ringtone creator, audio recorder and music mixing tool and start creating your masterpieces!\r\n\r\nAudioLab - Audio Editor Recorder & Ringtone Maker uses FFmpeg under LGPL & superpowered with Superpowered SDK\r\n\r\nFor any concerns or suggestions, please get in touch with us at support@hitrolab.com",
    "descriptionHTML": "<b>AudioLab - The Only Audio Editor App You Will Ever Need</b><br><br>Whether you are editing music, creating podcasts, recording memos, or just playing around with audio, AudioLab empowers you to unleash your creativity with unmatched versatility and ease of use. AudioLab - Audio Editor Recorder &amp; Ringtone Maker Free, Easy, Fast With NO Limits!<br><br>Your ultimate audio editing companion tailored for music enthusiasts, podcasters, and music creators who demand powerful tools at their fingertips.<br><br>\ud83c\udfb5AudioLab Advance sound editing features\ud83c\udfb5<br><br>\u2702\ufe0fEasy music editing tools\u2702\ufe0f<br>\u25cf Easily edit audio and videos all in one place<br>\u25cf Trim, clip, crop, copy, paste, add silence, fade, normalise, record song <br>\u25cf Supports every format( mp3, wav, flac, m4a, aac, ogg and more...)<br>\u25cf Millisecond level accuracy for editing<br><br>\ud83d\udd25Next-level song editing features with Professional Music Tools\ud83d\udd25<br>\u25cf Easily remove background noise with noise remover tool<br>\u25cf Normalise your sound and reduce/boost volume<br>\u25cf Inbuilt music player for playing music at any time<br>\u25cf 3d audio and 8d audio, voice and music separation<br>\u25cf Voice recorder, karaoke recorder, record voice with music<br>\u25cf Mix audio with various filters, sound maker, effects and SFX<br>\u25cf MP3 cutter, MP3 editor, audio editor, audio trimmer, ringtone maker and ringtone editor<br><br>\u2702\ufe0fSound Editor and MP3 Cutter\u2702\ufe0f<br>Advanced user interface to precisely cut best part of your sound and save it as your ringtone, alarm, music and notification<br><br>\ud83c\udf9e\ufe0fVideo editor\ud83c\udfa5<br>Video trim, video splitter, video to gif, video music mixer<br><br>\ud83c\udf9b\ufe0fAudio Mixer\ud83c\udf9b\ufe0f <br>Blend multiple audio tracks seamlessly to create professional-grade mixes<br><br>\ud83d\udd03Audio Convertor, Compress and Format Converter\ud83d\